        "conditionKey": "skillIcyQuillOwnAtk",
        "source": "Shenhe",
        "description": "Elemental Skill (Spring Spirit Summoning), self half: the Icy Quill raises the DMG of Normal, Charged and Plunging Attacks, Elemental Skills and Elemental Bursts that deal CRYO DMG by 82.18% of Shenhe's current ATK (skill Lv10). She is one of the nearby party members it is granted to, so when SHE is the scored character it reads her own live ATK through cryo_dmgIncFromAtk_ - element-scoped, not attack-type-scoped, because the clause keys off the DMG being Cryo whatever deals it. C3 raises Spring Spirit Summoning by three levels to Lv13 and the share with it (97.02%), hence the constellationStates block. The teammate half is skillIcyQuillFromAtk in others scope, which reads her ATK off a statInput instead. NOTE the Quill is consumed per trigger - 5 charges on Press, 7 on Hold - so weight the rotation accordingly rather than assuming every Cryo hit gets it.",
        "states": [
          {
            "value": "on",
            "modifiers": {
              "cryo_dmgIncFromAtk_": 0.8218
            }
          }
        ],
        "constellationStates": {
